    "_web_pages_help": "To watch another Tanzanian tender page, copy one block, change name, url and client. The page must show its list without logging in. must_contain (optional) keeps only notices containing one of those words, e.g. [\"tanzania\"] on an international page. A page that keeps FAILING in last_scan.txt can be switched off with enabled: false. Removed 1 Oct 2026 because they could not be read from GitHub's computers: ZPPDA (address does not exist), NMB and AfDB (refuse automatic readers, 403), TANESCO (JavaScript list, bad certificate), TAA (page removed, 404), RUWASA (closes the connection to foreign servers). Their tenders still reach NEXUS through NeST, DDO Tenders and TanzaniaTenders.com. | v3.1: optional \"group\": \"intl\" shows a page under Embassies · UN · international in NEXUS; \"browser\": false sends the old scanner identity; \"via\": \"reader\" always uses the public page reader, \"direct\" never; \"api\": {...} reads a public JSON search API (see EU Funding & Tenders / UK Contracts Finder).",
